OL,3,GNEWSAText message mental health support
OL,4,Aset to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new system for people suffering a
OL,7,Fmental health crisis to seek help via
OL,8,Ftext is due to be introduced this year.
OL,10,FLancashire and South Cumbria NHS
OL,11,FFoundation Trust is due to launch a
OL,12,F24-hour textline service to help people
OL,13,Fstruggling with their mental health.
OL,15,FThe service, which is expected to start
OL,16,Fin December, would also provide
OL,17,Femotional support and referral to
OL,18,Fappropriate services.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
